00:11:15,789 --> 00:11:21,789
Dead for a Dollar is a western, thriller, action film directed by Walter Hill.

3
00:16:53,684 --> 00:16:59,684
In 1897, veteran bounty hunter Max Borlund is deep into Mexico where he encounters professional
gambler and outlaw Joe Cribbens — a sworn enemy he sent to prison years before.

4
00:22:31,578 --> 00:22:37,578
Max is on a mission to find and return Rachel Kidd, the wife of a wealthy businessman, who as
the story is told to Max, has been abducted by Buffalo Soldier Elijah Jones.

5
00:28:09,473 --> 00:28:15,473
Max is ultimately faced with a showdown to save honor.

6
