01:07:34,736 --> 01:07:40,736
Dead for a Dollar is a 2022 American western action thriller
film written and directed by Walter Hill.

13
01:13:12,631 --> 01:13:18,631
It stars Christoph Waltz, Willem Dafoe, and Rachel Brosnahan.

14
01:18:50,526 --> 01:18:56,526
The plot follows a bounty hunter (Waltz) on a search to find
the missing wife (Brosnahan) of a businessman.

15
01:24:28,421 --> 01:24:34,421
Brandon Scott, Warren Burke, Benjamin Bratt, and Hamish Linklater also star.

16
